00</article-title>. <source>Lancet</source><volume>379</volume>: <fpage>2151</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>2161</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">22579125</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0051229-AkcanArikan1"><label>11</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Akcan-Arikan</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Zappitelli</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Loftis</surname><given-names>LL</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Washburn</surname><given-names>KK</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Jefferson</surname><given-names>LS</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2007</year>) <article-title>Modified RIFLE criteria in critically ill children with acute kidney injury</article-title>. <source>Kidney Int</source><volume>71</volume>: <fpage>1028</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1035</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17396113</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0051229-Schwartz1"><label>12</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Schwartz</surname><given-names>GJ</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Haycock</surname><given-names>GB</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Edelmann</surname><given-names>CM</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name>, <name><surname>Spitzer</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name> (<year>1976</year>) <article-title>A simple estimate of glomerular filtration rate in children derived from body length and plasma creatinine</article-title>. <source>Pediatrics</source><volume>58</volume>: <fpage>259</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>263</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">951142</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0051229-Goldstein1"><label>13</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Goldstein</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Giroir</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Randolph</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name> (<year>2005</year>) <article-title>International pediatric sepsis consensus conference: definitions for sepsis and organ dysfunction in pediatrics</article-title>. <source>Pediatr Crit Care Med</source><volume>6</volume>: <fpage>2</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15636651</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0051229-1"><label>14</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><article-title>The fourth report on the diagnosis, evaluation, and treatment of high blood pressure in children and adolescents</article-title>. <source>Pediatrics</source><volume>114</volume>: <fpage>22</fpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0051229-Duzova1"><label>15</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Duzova</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Bakkaloglu</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Kalyoncu</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Poyrazoglu</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Delibas</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2010</year>) <article-title>Etiology and outcome of acute kidney injury in children</article-title>. <source>Pediatr Nephrol</source><volume>25</volume>: <fpage>1453</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1461</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">20512652</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0051229-Ball1"><label>16</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Ball</surname><given-names>EF</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Kara</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name> (<year>2008</year>) <article-title>Epidemiology and outcome of acute kidney injury in New Zealand children</article-title>. <source>J Paediatr Child Health</source><volume>44</volume>: <fpage>642</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>646</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18717770</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0051229-OMeara1"><label>17</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>O'Meara</surname><given-names>WP</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Mangeni</surname><given-names>JN</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Steketee</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Greenwood</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name> (<year>2010</year>) <article-title>Changes in the burden of malaria in sub-Saharan Africa</article-title>. <source>Lancet Infect Dis</source><volume>10</volume>: <fpage>545</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>555</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">20637696</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0051229-Chertow1"><label>18</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Chertow</surname><given-names>GM</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Burdick</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Honour</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Bonventre</surname><given-names>JV</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Bates</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name> (<year>2005</year>) <article-title>Acute kidney injury, mortality, length of stay, and costs in hospitalized patients</article-title>. <source>J Am Soc Nephrol</source><volume>16</volume>: <fpage>3365</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>3370</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16177006</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0051229-Chang1"><label>19</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Chang</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Tsai</surname><given-names>HL</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>HH</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Yang</surname><given-names>LY</given-names></name> (<year>2008</year>) <article-title>Outcome and risk factors for mortality in children with acute renal failure</article-title>. <source>Clin Nephrol</source><volume>70</volume>: <fpage>485</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>489</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19049704</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0051229-Bunchman1"><label>20</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Bunchman</surname><given-names>TE</given-names></name>, <name><surname>McBryde</surname><given-names>KD</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Mottes</surname><given-names>TE</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Gardner</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Maxvold</surname><given-names>NJ</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2001</year>) <article-title>Pediatric acute renal failure: outcome by modality and disease</article-title>. <source>Pediatr Nephrol</source><volume>16</volume>: <fpage>1067</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1071</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11793102</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0051229-Bresolin1"><label>21</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Bresolin</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Silva</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Halllal</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Toporovski</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Fernandes</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2009</year>) <article-title>Prognosis for children with acute kidney injury in the intensive care unit</article-title>. <source>Pediatr Nephrol</source><volume>24</volume>: <fpage>537</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>544</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19050934</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>